###==== Electrical attributes required by PDS
### User I/O is 3.3 V LVCMOS.  DDR3 Bank 3 is 1.5 V SSTL15;
### the DQS/CK pairs use the differential SSTL15D standard.
### reset_n=W17 follows the board reset location used by the generated
### PGL50H DDR3 example; verify this one pin against the physical manual.
